+    Horry County                                                                             Marion D. Foxworth, III
+   Register of Deeds                       The Independent Republic
+                                                                                                    Registrar of Deeds
+
+
+1301 Second Avenue  Conway, South Carolina 29526  Phone: 843.915.5430  Fax: 843.915.6430
+
+                        Register of Deeds Copy Request Form
+In order to provide quality customer service and maintain accuracy in our transactions, the Register of Deeds
+requires certain information to find the correct document. Please complete the following questions.
+Please print.
+Person Making Request:
+Name and complete address: ______________________________________________________________________
+Phone Number: ___________________________________________________________________________________
+
+Required Information:
+Name on document: _________________________________________________________________________
+
+Type of document requested: _________________________________________________________________
+
+Complete as much as possible of the following:
+Book/page of document(s): ___________________________________________________________________
+
+Tax Map Number (TMS or PIN): ________________________________________________________________
+
+Property Address: ___________________________________________________________________________
+
+Brief Property Description: ____________________________________________________________________
+                           (ex. Lot #, Subdivision, Acreage, Township or if timeshare: Unit #, Week #, Name of Resort)
+Please check one:      Certified legal copy ($2.00 extra fee)              Normal copy        Number of copies: _______
+Fee Information:
+There is a fee to receive a copy of a document. The fee is $8.00 for the first 4 pages and $1.00 for each
+additional page. If the document you want is a plat, the fee is $5.00 for a small (8.5x11 or 11x17) copy or
+$10.00 for a large (24x36) copy. We can also provide a certified copy, which is a true legal copy. There is an
+extra $2.00 fee for certification. We can accept check or money order through the mail. If you are unsure of the
+number of pages, feel free to contact us at (843) 915-5430 and we can search for the page count. The number of
+pages can also be found on our website: https://acclaimweb.horrycounty.org/AcclaimWeb/. Here you can
+search for the document by the person’s name using last name, first name format with no punctuation. (ex.
+Smith John) The search results will show all the documents under this name since 1984. If you would like help
+searching, please contact us.
+Please make checks or money orders payable to the Register of Deeds. Please include your account number if you wish
+          to pay using your customer escrow account. Customer Escrow Account Number:_____________
+
+                                      Mail Requests to: Register of Deeds
+                                                        PO Box 470
+                                                        Conway, SC 29528
+
\ No newline at end of file
